  "title": "Virgin Mojito",
  "description": null,
  "editorial": {
    "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Just because I don't drink alcohol doesn't mean that I have to stick with plain water... This virgin mojito is a perfect beverage for any family and friends gatherings. &nbsp;There are many ways to make virgin mojito. &nbsp;Personally, I think the version with Ginger Ale tastes the best.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:wp-recipe-maker/recipe {\"id\":21292,\"template\":\"chic-template-english\",\"updated\":1752282079274} -->\n<!--WPRM Recipe 21292-->\n<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe\">\n\t<h2 class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-name\">Virgin Mojito</h2>\n\t<img class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-image\" src=\"https://mycafegourmand.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/IMG_5986.Blog_.Blog_-150x150.png\"/>\t<p class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-summary\">\n\t\t\t</p>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-equipment\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-ingredients\">\n\t\t<ul><li>4 limes</li><li>2 lemons</li><li>1 big bunch of mint</li><li>10 cups ice cubes</li><li>2 (1.5 L)  bottle of sparkling water or club soda</li><li>1 (1 l) bottle of ginger ale</li></ul>\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-instructions\">\n\t\t<ol><li>Slice lemons and limes.</li><li> In a big jar combine the limes, lemons, fresh mint and ice cubes together.</li><li>Top with sparkling water, Ginger Ale and stir.</li></ol>\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-notes\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-meta\">\n\t\t<div class=\"wprm-fallback-recipe-meta-course\">Drinks</div>\t</div>\n</div>\n<!--End WPRM Recipe-->\n<!-- /wp:wp-recipe-maker/recipe -->",
    "excerpt": "This virgin mojito is a perfect beverage for any family and friends gatherings or a party. There are many ways to make virgin mojito."
  },
